11-CONC#,#Urban Studies#,#HASS Concentration in Urban Studies#,#Concentration in Urban Studies

A concentration in Urban Studies requires three HASS subjects tailored to student interests. Students select subjects from Urban Studies and Planning courses.

intro_urban, "Introductory Urban Subjects" := 11.001, 11.002, 11.003, 11.005, 11.006, 11.007, 11.008, 11.011, 11.013, 11.014, 11.015, 11.016, 11.021, 11.022, 11.024, 11.025, 11.026, 11.027, 11.029, 11.041, 11.045, 11.047, 11.067, 11.068, 11.071, 11.074, 11.085, 11.092

specialized_urban, "Specialized Urban Subjects" := 11.100, 11.107, 11.111, 11.113, 11.114, 11.118, 11.119, 11.122, 11.123, 11.124, 11.125, 11.127, 11.129, 11.130, 11.131, 11.133, 11.134, 11.135, 11.136, 11.137, 11.138, 11.139, 11.140, 11.142, 11.143, 11.144, 11.145, 11.147, 11.148, 11.149, 11.150, 11.152, 11.154, 11.C35, 11.155, 11.156, 11.157, 11.158, 11.159, 11.164, 11.165, 11.166, 11.167, 11.169, 11.170, 11.171, 11.173

all_urban, "All Urban Studies Courses" := intro_urban / specialized_urban

total, "Three Urban Studies Subjects" := (all_urban){>=3}

